  "instructions": [
    {
      "primary_message": "Wash and dry the fresh produce.",
      "secondary_message": "¼ small bunch Italian (flat-leaf) parsley\n½ head butter (Boston) lettuce"
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "TO MAKE THE CARROT SLAW: Shave parsley leaves off the stems; discard stems and mince the leaves. Place in a medium bowl along with mayo, vinegar, maple syrup, poppy seeds, and spices. Whisk to combine the dressing.\n\n",
      "secondary_message": "mayonnaise\n1 tbsp apple cider vinegar\n2 tsp pure maple syrup\n2 tsp poppy seeds\n¼ tsp garlic powder\n¼ tsp salt\n⅛ tsp black pepper"
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "Peel and trim carrots. Using the vegetable peeler, peel a long, thin strip off of one carrot and set aside to make the \"tongue.\" Coarsely grate remaining carrots, then add to the bowl with dressing. Stir to combine the slaw and set aside.\n\n",
      "secondary_message": null
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "TO ASSEMBLE THE SANDWICHES: Split the baguette in half lengthwise (cutting through it horizontally). Spread the top half of the baguette with mayo and set aside.\n\n",
      "secondary_message": "1 loaf baguette\n3 tbsp mayonnaise"
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "Layer the bottom half of the baguette with carrot slaw, ham, and cheese. Close with the top half of the baguette. Cut baguette crosswise into 2-inch wide sandwiches.",
      "secondary_message": "227 g deli ham, sliced\n10 slice Muenster cheese, sliced"
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "Separate lettuce into leaves. Arrange leaves on a platter as the base for your \"snake.\" Arrange sandwiches on top of the lettuce, so that they are touching in a curvy \"S\" shape to create your \"snake.\"",
      "secondary_message": null
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "Cut a \"V\" out of one end of your carrot tongue. Insert this into the \"mouth\" of your snake. Add olive slices for \"eyes.\"",
      "secondary_message": "1 tsp sliced black olives"
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "Share and enjoy!",
      "secondary_message": null
    }
  ],
